<title>UK: LW Rentenbank adds $25 million to 4-year bond.</title>
<headline>LW Rentenbank adds $25 million to 4-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDWIRTSCHAFTLICHE RENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    *$100 MLN     COUPON    **5.0	MATURITY    10.OCT.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  101.40    PAY DATE    10.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   REOFFER    100.0     SPREAD	+2 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINAL $75 MLN LAUNCHED 27.AUG.96</p>
<p>	     **FOR YEARS ONE AND TWO STEPS UP TO 8.50 PCT</p>
<p>		 THEREAFTER</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND U.S. TREASURY DUE AUG 1999</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
